  "description": "VUCWOI crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 4/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C144 H168 Gd9 N16 O42 1-,H3 O1 1+,4(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 10 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd6 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd7 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd8 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd9 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 20 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.655-5.185 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.11-173.82°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C144H179Gd9N16O47. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 μ5-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
